                                "sense_id": "2f885516-e896-350a-b702-89ea0a39aa38",
                                "text": "Marla Rose, a 57-year-old Berwyn resident, told cops that after seeing an online Fuentes post “in regards to women’s rights” that declared, “Your body my choice,” she decided to “record a video” of Fuentes’s Berwyn property."
